<title>ITALY: Forli air cargo traffic down 3.0pct in March 97.</title>
<headline>Forli air cargo traffic down 3.0pct in March 97.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo traffic handled at Forli airport in Italy fell three percent in March 1997 to 424 tonnes compared to the same month last year, Forli airport authority SEAF said.</p>
<p>January-February 1997 cargo handled totalled 1,020 tonnes, down 20 percent.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
